{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvTXklMjBHaXJsJTIwJTI4MTk5MSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"My Girl","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qyJJNHteA7BUwQSey05t7qP4vRV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vSd89kiENYeFa6mPHzsM5BgliPm.jpg","description":"Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is \"allergic to everything\", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada's father hires Shelly, and begins to fall for her, things take a turn to the worse...","releaseInfo":"1991","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.4","runtime":"103 min","cast":["Anna Chlumsky","Macaulay Culkin","Dan Aykroyd","Jamie Lee Curtis","Richard Masur","Griffin Dunne","Ann Nelson","Peter Michael Goetz"],"director":["Howard Zieff"],"released":"1991-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"When your Dad's an undertaker, your Mom's in heaven, and your Grandma's got a screw loose...it's good to have a friend who understands you. Even if he is a boy.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anna Chlumsky","character":"Vada Sultenfuss","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y5FMFdsORlQVhUWiR8yC35COlpO.jpg"},{"name":"Macaulay Culkin","character":"Thomas J. Sennett","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5We9Y4zUJ5TUnRgfmkzWQx0mLIF.jpg"},{"name":"Dan Aykroyd","character":"Harry Sultenfuss","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iVMmeVJx8IpCEjlGBZWzIWvX5Qo.jpg"},{"name":"Jamie Lee Curtis","character":"Shelly DeVoto","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eWKubKAAssRzmFwCZKh1mdYqGCH.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Masur","character":"Phil Sultenfuss","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yRJCKYoW16HaDEXy37ORnBFBOg7.jpg"},{"name":"Griffin Dunne","character":"Mr. Jake Bixler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oZeAznfOHgK1Kvy9T